# This mod ships no art and no ROM data.  Every portrait is cut, at runtime,
# out of the engine's own extraction of the player's own ROM, so there is
# nothing ROM-derived in this tree to ignore -- the entries below exist so that
# a local experiment cannot commit one by accident.
#
# ROM images.  Never commit these, in this repo or any other.
*.gba
*.gbc
*.gb
*.gba.sav
*.sav
*.sa1
Pokemon_FireRed.gba
Pokemon_LeafGreen.gba

# ROM-hack patch formats -- same reasoning, they carry Nintendo's data.
*.ips
*.ups
*.bps
*.aps

# Verbatim, un-cropped ROM extracts, if a fork ever produces any while working
# on art/crops.lua locally.  Not a derivative work, but not something to ship.
art/trainers_raw/
art/pokemon_raw/

# Build output.  The release artifacts are built by CI from the tagged tree and
# attached to the GitHub Release; they are never committed.  See
# .github/workflows/release.yml, and MANUAL.md's "Releasing it".
*.modpkg
gen3-dialogue-portraits-*.zip
dist/

# OS junk
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
